---

<section class="showreel section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="showreel-frame" data-reveal>
      <span class="showreel-caption">
        [Photo/Vidéo — plan large d'un temps fort BAKASAB en pleine énergie, public engagé]
        <span class="placeholder-filename">→ à uploader : src/assets/hero/showreel.jpg</span>
      </span>
      <button class="showreel-play" aria-label="Voir la vidéo">
        <svg width="20" height="22" viewBox="0 0 20 22" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <path d="M19 9.27C20.33 10.04 20.33 11.96 19 12.73L3.5 21.66C2.17 22.43 0.5 21.47 0.5 19.93L0.5 2.07C0.5 0.53 2.17 -0.43 3.5 0.34L19 9.27Z" fill="currentColor"/>
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .showreel-frame {
    position: relative;
    height: clamp(360px, 60vw, 640px);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--ink) 0%, var(--bordeaux-dim) 55%, var(--orange-dim) 100%);
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-end;
    padding: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .showreel-caption {
    color: var(--cream);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
    max-width: 42ch;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 45%, transparent);
    padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-md);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  }

  .showreel-play {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    width: 96px;
    height: 96px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--cream);
    color: var(--ink);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    transition: transform 0.4s var(--ease-out), background-color 0.3s;
  }

  .showreel-play:hover {
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.08);
    background: var(--orange);
    color: var(--cream);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .showreel-play {
      width: 72px;
      height: 72px;
    }
  }
</style>
